        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Dil_Ninja\" data-post=\"16\" data-topic=\"28888\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dil_ninja/48/5218_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Dil_Ninja:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I think since the original question also referred to dimensional travelers like Visionary and KNYFE,</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That was actually a secondary question of whether or not people who retroactively apply the term to them even though they’re a slightly different, but ultimately very similar, category. Then whether or not the term would also apply to Miss Information is an even bigger question</p>",
