        "cooked": "<p>Off the top of my head, all the non-mistportal dimensional travelers would be: KNYFE, Visionary, Omnitron-X, and an unknown number of ex-FILTER agents.</p>\n<p>Miss Information and Darkmind also probably count, but I don’t think anyone knows Miss Info’s origin and I doubt the government is going to try to classify and civilize an incorporeal ex-Scion.</p>",
